    "detailed_description": "<strong>The doctor said today was my last appointment, I'm healthy. Time to go home, what could go wrong?</strong><br><br><strong>My Last Appointment</strong> is a short walking simulator inspired by liminal spaces, internet memes about backrooms and the aesthetics of the unpleasant corridors of post-Soviet medical facilities. This game will test your attention to details.<br><br>If you're worried about the foreign language in the screenshots, you don't need to worry about that reason. Passing the game does not require understanding the language.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785980/extras/9e9b6cf953d9a5b4866a911b36181064.poster.avif?t=1751638764\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785980/extras/9e9b6cf953d9a5b4866a911b36181064.webm?t=1751638764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785980/extras/9e9b6cf953d9a5b4866a911b36181064.mp4?t=1751638764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Approximate playthrough time is 15-60 minutes.</strong>",
